    "id": "superexam-anatomy-0032",
    "subject": "anatomy",
    "originalNumber": 32,
    "stem": "An oncologist is reviewing a CT scan of a 74-year-old man\nwith newly diagnosed hepatocellular carcinoma. He locates\nthe affected quadrate lobe of the liver that:",
