    "subject": "anatomy",
    "originalNumber": 34,
    "stem": "A 2-year-old boy presents with pain in his groin that has\nbeen increasing over the past few weeks. He is found to have\na\ndegenerative malformation of the transversalis fascia during\ndevelopment. Which of the following structures on the\nanterior abdominal wall is likely defective?",
