    "stem": "A 63 year old female patient says that she has pain in her\ngroin and upper thigh. Upon examination, you palpate a\nlump located below the inguinal ligament, lateral to its\nattachment to the pubic tubercle. You suspect that this may\nbe a hernia passing through the:",
