    "stem": "A 27/F has multiple closed comedones on her nose. She then\nproceeded to squeeze them individually. After a few days she\nhad a severe headache which was followed by high grade\nfever, periorbital edema and diplopia. A diagnosis of\ncavernous sinus thrombosis was made. Which is/are found\ninside the cavernous sinus?",
