    "subject": "anatomy",
    "originalNumber": 436,
    "stem": "A 15-year old skateboarder lost balance and fell on his\noutstretched right hand causing hyperextension of the wrist\njoint . He then manifest numbness and pain over the palmar\naspects of his right thumb, index and middle fingers. Which\nof the following mechanisms of injury will most likely\nexplain the symptoms?",
