    "explanation": "The tributaries of portal vein are the splenic vein,\ninferior mesenteric vein, superior mesenteric vein,\nleft gastric vein, right gastric vein, and cystic veins.\nMedian sacral vein directly drains to left common\niliac vein then to inferior vena cava.",
