    "explanation": "The body of the uterus is related anteriorly to the\nuterovesical pouch and the superior surface of the\nbladder. Perforation is usually caused by a surgical\ninstrument used for scraping and removing\nmaterial from the uterus. The instrument\npenetrates through the uterine wall, and rarely,\nmay migrate into the abdominal cavity where the\nbladder may also be perforated.",
