    "subject": "anatomy",
    "originalNumber": 455,
    "stem": "A 48 year-old fish vendor was stabbed by an unknown\nassailant at the back. He was rushed to the ER with BP 60\npalpatory, PR=130s, RR=20s. Which particular structure of\nthe kidney will be stimulated as a result of the above\nfindings:",
