    "stem": "A 40/F with known tooth infection comes in due to a large,\ntender, fluctuant mass occupying the left lower side of her\nface and upper neck including the underside of the mouth.\nOn examination, the mass is seen pushing up the floor of the\nmouth on the left side. This patient has an acute infection of\nthis fascial space which is usually due to dental infection.",
