    "originalNumber": 650,
    "stem": "While jogging, a 40 y/o male was bumped by a tricycle on the\nlateral side of his left leg. Patient was unable to evert his left\nfoot, with weakness in plantar flexion but normal\ndorsiflexion. What nerve was affected?",
